      "updated": 1787486400000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "index": "cJ",
      "text": "PLATFORM REUSE / ROADMAP\nMac → Windows reuses these same native desktop sender and ordinary browser receiver surfaces.\n\nWindows → Mac also fits this V1 model.\n\niPhone → Windows sending is roadmap-only; it needs a future native mobile sender surface.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 101,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "PLATFORM REUSE / ROADMAP\nMac → Windows reuses these same native desktop sender and ordinary browser receiver surfaces.\n\nWindows → Mac also fits this V1 model.\n\niPhone → Windows sending is roadmap-only; it needs a future native mobile sender surface.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": false
    },
